  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "6 seater Golf Cart Included! <br>So close to the beach! Our 3 Bedroom 3 Bath home, with fantastic Gulf Views from both levels of the home. All 3 bedrooms have nice patios, and the Master Bedroom and Living room both have those Gulf Views that everyone will adore!<br><br>We feature out street private parking for 2 large vehicles. Inside, you'll find on the first floor, a large master suite, with King bed, nicely appointed master bath suite with separate tub and walk in shower, and dual vanity sinks. Walk right out the bedroom to a fantastic new gulf facing deck.<br><br>The second bedroom on the first level features another large room with queen/twin trundle bed and full bed with private bath. Another private large balcony off of this bedroom as well. This level also features a full sized laundry.<br><br>Leading up to the second level, you'll be amazed with the fantastic gulf views, from the \"open concept\" Living/dining/kitchen area. Off of that, another very large deck, perfect for enjoying those beach views!<br><br>The kitchen is stocked and well appointed. Keurig coffee maker, crockpot, griddle, blender and beverage mugs for the beach. The living room also features a very nice, comfortable queen sofa sleeper.<br><br>The third bedroom is also on the second level, with private bath, and queen/twin trundle bed and bunk beds with hallway bathroom, and another private balcony.<br><br>A great community pool is also available, less than a block away. Beach access is close by to hit the sand and water! Great dining choices on 30A which is a block away. Restaurants include Shunk Gulley, Perfect Pig, Pizza by the Sea, Local Catch and La Playa. On the corner you will find, Under the Sea for snacks, sandwiches, ice cream, bike rentals, golf carts, and beach toys.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
